  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: engineering, github, models-openrouter. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Aidenhq/review status mirror, a thread per finding, posts that survive restarts, faster per-push reviews",
    "Stuck-gate watchdog and a write-review combination test",
    "Mandatory repos gate merges on resolved important findings",
    "One access policy for every reviewer, a read-only shell with the network on",
    "Codex-native engine, Codex's built-in codex exec review",
    "A temporary skill_findings combo field to backtest Claude Code's own findings cut",
    "A check records when it got its box",
    "Size the box pool from the host and guarantee each kind of job half",
    "Judge authorization and safety only, and the owner's ai_review_code setting",
    "Retire a reviewer eval case only on the owner's list, read from the base",
    "Review a change of any size with read-only tools over the change",
    "No size refusals before the AI reviewer, and a per-review spend cap",
    "Price Gemini 4 Neon and Carbon",
    "Price GPT Terra and GPT Astra (latest aliases)",
    "The review budget is a per-day cap at real cost; no other caps",
    "A gate an agent is working on doesn't page the owner",
    "Waiting is not failing in the merge queue, plan and PR watch",
    "Grader outages close done ungraded; dispatch retries infrastructure failures with backoff",
    "A snoozed card parks by its date and shows until when"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.21"
}
